    "ParentObjectID": "act_iron_large_saw",
    "LocalizationKey": "Advanced_Copper_Tools_IronLargeSaw_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "A large two-handled saw with a forged iron blade. Tougher than the copper saw, and it drops a large pine or willow in one pull."
